<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Astoria started neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Astoria started neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of Astoria Financial Corp with a neutral rating on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares were flat in late morning trading at 46-7/8.</p>
</text>
